{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778977003460,"sessionID":"ses_1ccba4ff2ffemtqXSMlndC5QNl","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_NEnOBoR5xMemsPA9isfHmYNL","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Implemented in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Obsoleted these four MONDO terms based on the OMIM merges described in the issue and pointed them to the requested replacement terms:\n+- MONDO:0009027 -> MONDO:0007402\n+- MONDO:0011961 -> MONDO:0044720\n+- MONDO:0010553 -> MONDO:0010549\n+- MONDO:0013935 -> MONDO:0012273\n+\n+I also transferred the relevant historical synonyms/xrefs onto the surviving terms so the merged concepts remain traceable.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+Summary:\n+Obsoleted four MONDO terms that correspond to OMIM records merged upstream, and rewired each obsoleted term to the requested surviving MONDO term.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Obsoleted `MONDO:0009027` and added `replaced_by: MONDO:0007402`.\n+- Obsoleted `MONDO:0011961` and added `replaced_by: MONDO:0044720`.\n+- Obsoleted `MONDO:0010553` and added `replaced_by: MONDO:0010549`.\n+- Obsoleted `MONDO:0013935` and added `replaced_by: MONDO:0012273`.\n+- Added `property_value: IAO:0000231 MONDO:TermsMerged` and issue tracking metadata to the four obsolete stanzas.\n+- Reduced each obsolete stanza to obsoletion-safe content only.\n+- Transferred historical labels and database references from the obsoleted terms to the surviving terms to preserve discoverability and mapping continuity.\n+\n+Transferred content highlights:\n+- `MONDO:0007402` gained the historical synonym for familial adolescent cramps and the MEDGEN/OMIM/UMLS references from `MONDO:0009027`.\n+- `MONDO:0010549` gained the historical Charcot-Marie-Tooth/Friedreich ataxia combined synonym and associated MEDGEN/MESH/OMIM/UMLS references from `MONDO:0010553`.\n+- `MONDO:0044720` gained HSAN1B historical synonyms, xrefs, and relevant subset provenance from `MONDO:0011961`.\n+- `MONDO:0012273` gained Usher type 1J historical synonyms and cross-references from `MONDO:0013935`.\n+\n+Validation checklist completed:\n+- Read `__issue_context__.json` and confirmed the requested replacements.\n+- Checked the affected term stanzas in `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo` before editing.\n+- Verified there were no remaining references to the four obsoleted MONDO IDs outside their own stanzas after check-in.\n+- Ran `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o /tmp/opencode/mondo-edit.TMP.obo` successfully as a syntax check.\n+- Confirmed no `alt_id` entries were introduced for the obsoleted IDs.\n+- Validated PMID:12870133 and PMID:16311270 against PubMed before preserving them on `MONDO:0044720`.\n+\n+Environment note:\n+- `docker` and `aurelian` were not available in this environment, so I could not run the ODK `make NORM` workflow or use `aurelian fulltext`. I used direct `robot convert`, `obo-grep.pl`, and PubMed lookups for validation instead.\n+\n+Committed locally as:\n+- `992a64d` `Obsolete OMIM merged terms`\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+Implemented in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Obsoleted these four MONDO terms based on the OMIM merges described in the issue and pointed them to the requested replacement terms:\n+- MONDO:0009027 -> MONDO:0007402\n+- MONDO:0011961 -> MONDO:0044720\n+- MONDO:0010553 -> MONDO:0010549\n+- MONDO:0013935 -> MONDO:0012273\n+\n+I also transferred the relevant historical synonyms/xrefs onto the surviving